<title>USA: U.S. stocks roar higher at open, techs surge.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks roar higher at open, techs surge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks jumped higher at the opening on Friday with the Nasdaq gains about twice that of the Dow Industrials and Standard &amp; Poor's 500 Index.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials indiex rose 26 points to 6,469. The long bond was strong, rising 9/32 to yield 6.72 percent.</p>
